WEBVTT

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:39.740
Okay, I won't be home until evening,
so have Jun-kun order out for lunch.

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:41.220
Okay!

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.680
Got it.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.480
It's summer break, 
but you have lots of school.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:48.520
The tourney's close, 
so it's extracurricular.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:49.680
Extracurricular?

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:50.590
Lacrosse.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:53.650
Well, I'm off!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.620
I'll tell you a secret.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.930
Using that stick-like weapon
to crack open enemy heads...

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:05.030
they battle in a game of death
until one side is incapacitated.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:09.870
Sear into your mind this image
of Nori going into battle.

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:11.870
Watch the house.

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:15.630
N-N-N-N-Nori, don't die!

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.540
Get behind them

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.770
and aim for the cervical vertebrae, you!

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:18.380
Fight, fight, fight!

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:22.880
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:36.440
Hey.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:38.150
What?

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:41.900
Where are you always 
getting those books from?

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.690
From the room with the mirror.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.620
I can't read anything...

00:02:57.430 --> 00:02:59.160
That's in German.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.140
"The Psychology of Alchemy
and the Unconscious"

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.620
If you're interested, you could.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:05.320
How?

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.490
You are my medium.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:11.860
You share various powers with me.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:16.800
Focus your senses and the book's contents
should naturally flow in.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:19.300
I can't even read English books.

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.120
That's because you're 
not focused enough.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.550
I don't get anything.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:30.650
Because I lied.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.430
Fool.

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:35.890
Why you...

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:39.040
You lying doll! 
Talking so superior!

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:41.250
Reading it wouldn't be so easy.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.260
What did you say?

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.840
She's acting strange.

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:48.260
She wants to divert the fact
that all dolls are present.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.960
She's strong if she can relax.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.480
She may be a formidable foe.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.380
What are you saying?

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.240
A foe...

00:03:55.940 --> 00:04:00.380
That all the dolls are present
means the start of the Alice Game.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:03.250
We may have to fight someday.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.180
That is Father's...

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.250
That's not my problem!

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:11.130
Of course I love Father...

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:14.690
but I love you and the 
others almost as much.

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:19.430
If I have to end up taking 
your Rosa Mystica...

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:22.770
I don't care if I can't become Alice.

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:26.270
We'll always, always be together.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:30.890
If Bara-Suishou comes after you...

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:34.280
I will protect you without fail.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.600
By finding a master quickly...

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.660
Covenant

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.660
Take this with you too.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:51.540
Since I hear it looks like rain today.

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.260
Thank you.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:54.900
Um...

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:00.040
Well, thank you for your 
hospitality all this time.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:03.910
Um, I have to find a master because...

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:04.810
well...

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.510
Don't, Suiseiseki.

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:09.540
This isn't goodbye.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:11.780
Grandpa...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.370
That's right, Sui-chan.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:18.210
The puny human lives 
in the neighborhood.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.320
You could visit...

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:22.130
Come now, it's Jun-kun.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.290
Oh my.

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:26.640
I've picked up Sui-chan's
habit of calling him that.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:29.160
Jun?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.900
Finding a master means
you're going to Jun-kun, right?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.660
Who would...

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.700
You're not?

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.500
Will you wind?

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.980
Will you not wind?

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:56.590
Take the offer now and a cute
younger sister might come...

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.980
Oh, hung up again.

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:09.570
Sakurada, Tsuyoshi
Sakurada, Takuya
Sakurada, Matsuko

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.670
Honestly!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.570
None of them understand!

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.910
Let's go to Jun's place 
and not be stubborn.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:27.620
Well, if you're going to insist so,
I won't mind going for you.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:36.310
Honestly, how long is he
going to be in the bathroom?

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:40.500
Jun reads magazines in the bathroom lately,
so it will be a long time.

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:46.930
It's definitely a wonderful place,
so I guess it's relaxing.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:50.070
But I do question reading magazines.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.310
I'll go bang on the bathroom door!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.430
Oh, you're visiting?

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:02.960
Uh, well...

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:06.320
Actually, Suiseiseki's 
looking for a master.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:07.520
Really?

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:08.780
She's here for Jun?

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:10.050
Me?

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.460
Um... Um... Um...

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.930
Suiseiseki loves Jun too?

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:20.490
Like hell I do!

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.070
Don't be so bigheaded!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:26.440
Suiseiseki!

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.510
What's up with her?

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.860
Suiseiseki!

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:55.800
You can't lie around 
lazily for long, I guess?

00:07:56.310 --> 00:07:58.560
Today, Kanaria will surely...

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:05.350
Oh?

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.440
What now?

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.990
Return to Grandfather's place?

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:25.120
I don't want to.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.980
Crawling back
after leaving is pathetic.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.640
Then Jun's house...

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:31.330
No to that too.

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.990
Then what will you do?

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:44.320
Jun...

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:50.490
Man...

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:55.200
Y-You can give it to him!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.240
It's your idea.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.930
You're so stubborn!

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:00.720
The stubborn one...

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.940
Hey, what are you doing?

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:11.640
Um...

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.750
We have two, so here.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:19.120
T-Thanks.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:25.520
Honestly, you are such
a hopeless dolt, puny human.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:26.530
What?

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:29.410
If we don't enter a covenant...

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.440
...you'll end up dead in a ditch!

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.260
No choice...

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:33.420
Hey, wait!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.770
Who asked for a covenant?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.590
I haven't fallen so far as to choose
a bungling puny master either!

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:41.370
What?

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:46.490
I'll never enter a covenant 
with the likes of you!

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.630
You bungling bungle-head!

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.520
That damn rotten doll...

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:55.400
Suiseiseki...

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.860
Notaro

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:02.610
See if I care about you anymore, Jun.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:07.460
I'm in a pinch, I guess?

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.060
Could that have been the seventh doll?

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:14.920
To think that she's 
out there somewhere...

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:17.170
What a miscalculation, I guess?

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:19.910
At this rate, she'll steal...

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.140
Say that again,
 you big forehead!

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:31.180
At home, Suiseiseki helps
Grandmother out a lot.

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:32.180
Huh...

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:39.870
And Suiseiseki's good 
at making roasted tea.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.620
Not normal tea?

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:44.550
Grandfather likes roasted tea.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:45.700
That's why...

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.240
What are you blabbing away about
while I'm not around?

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.100
Think a little about hiding...

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:54.840
This isn't the time!

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:56.850
Shinku and Hina-Ichigo are in danger!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:05.720
Rain. Rain. Rain.

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:10.930
Hey, Shinku, would you think
rain was great if it was juice?

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:14.580
Would you think it was 
great if it was milk?

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:16.340
Hey...

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.420
Boo.

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:22.510
I'm bored!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.140
Bara-Suishou.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.230
Shinku!

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:09.320
Shinku...
 Hina-Ichigo...

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.550
It must be the mirror room.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.610
I'm telling you it's the water puddle.

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:23.980
How distrustful you are!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:25.830
The water puddle!

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:26.930
Water puddle?

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:31.720
That?

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.400
This is...

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.000
The N Field.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:58.660
Suiseiseki!

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.600
Hey!

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:07.840
My butt hurts a little, I guess?

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.260
Where...

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:14.050
Hey, hey,
 what a thing to do, you woman!

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:19.250
It doesn't look like this 
is Bara-Suishou's field.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:26.990
Jun-kun!

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.580
Why'd he come too?

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:31.730
You'll only get in our way!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:35.160
What I do isn't your problem!

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.470
Oh!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.130
Jun!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.390
Hina-Ichigo...

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:40.840
Shinku...

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.560
Thank goodness.

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:44.380
You're both all right.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.810
Where's Bara-Suishou?

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.560
We lost sight of her.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:52.110
We had come here before
we knew what was going on.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.550
Shinku.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:56.810
Hina-Ichigo.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.660
Suiseiseki.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.520
Souseiseki.

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:00.350
This voice...

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:01.880
Kanaria.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:04.860
And Bara-Suishou.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:08.030
She's the one...

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:13.040
Dolls drawn together 
by puppet strings...

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:17.290
To be woven is a tapestry of fate...

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:21.540
The story's main characters
have now assembled here.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:26.990
At last, the curtain shall rise
upon the Alice Game.

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:18.600
Stop this.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.910
Hina's puppet...

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:34.580
This is so disgusting!

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.880
It's the Alice Game.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:51.560
Stop...

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.630
Stop...

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:02.140
Stop... Stop...

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:06.010
Kana-puppet, stand up! 
Stand up, I guess?

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:15.120
Once we begin the Alice Game,
eventually we will...

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:20.220
Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.860
Shinku!
 Puny Ichigo!

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:24.550
Don't be intimidated by such a farce!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:25.590
That's right!

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:29.320
That's not like you guys at all!

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:30.470
Jun...

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:33.200
There's no way that'll happen!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:39.930
In that case...

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:42.750
Let us begin...

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.440
...the real Alice Game.

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.830
T-This is a little dicey, I guess?

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:13.480
Suiseiseki!

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.100
Shinku!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.290
I-I...

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.960
Shinku, you're...

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.610
Souseiseki!

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:01.000
Jun!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:11.160
Damn it...

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.170
Jun...

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:17.270
I'll do it!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.740
I'll enter the covenant!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.480
Jun...

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:42.500
What's wrong?

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:56.240
Sui Dream!

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:08.450
Now that I have a medium, 
you're no threat!

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.400
It's hot...

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:17.670
We're running!

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:20.670
Shinku! Souseiseki!
 We're leaving!

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:22.260
Jun...

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.670
Shinku, let's go!

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:50.080
Our Alice Game...

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:58.020
Give my regards to Gramps and Grandma.

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:02.180
A-Also, tell them the light
in the bathroom is going out.

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:06.060
Um, and also, that I'll 
come stay over sometimes.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:06.980
Also...

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:07.880
Suiseiseki.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:17.450
I'll come visit again tomorrow,
so you can tell me then.

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:20.250
Souseiseki...

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.190
We can see each other anytime.

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.060
We're sisters after all.

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:35.120
I'll come visit every single day.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:37.070
We'll be together forever.

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:09.970
What are you doing?

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:11.730
Reading a book.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:13.760
A math study guide?

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:14.380
Yes.

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:20.480
Grandma always used to read to me
before I went to sleep.

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:28.490
SMELBORP
HTAM

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:32.790
You multiply this x by 
3 and divide it by 4.

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:34.710
Then you take x...

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:36.500
Is this interesting?

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.780
It's interesting!

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:42.400
This x guy is quite promising!

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.340
Keep reading.

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:47.840
Let's see...

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:51.260
Then you solve
for the value of x plus 5.

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:52.690
I see. I see.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:59.940
They left me behind! 
How awful can they be?

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:03.220
My butt!

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:10.310
I'll get back at you someday, I guess?

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:45.800
Suiseiseki's got a 
covenant with Jun too!

00:23:45.800 --> 00:23:47.090
She's living with us!

00:23:47.260 --> 00:23:51.510
I would've snubbed this rabbit hut,
but I've no choice. In exchange...

00:23:51.880 --> 00:23:53.800
I'm taking all your space.

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:55.130
Hurry up and move over!

00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:59.240
And when I get up in the morning,
bring me breakfast.

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:01.780
She's tougher than Shinku.

00:24:01.780 --> 00:24:03.610
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:04.060 --> 00:24:07.040
Its melody is like a dream.

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:10.850
Chapter 5
The Letter
